1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 8=

10
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,520
Great-Aunt, are you really
not going to the Qi Residence?

11
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,840
If you invite me,

12
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:57,240
I must naturally go.

13
00:00:57,470 --> 00:00:59,670
It's just that today,
a master who once saved my life

14
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:01,880
is coming to visit.

15
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:04,560
It's a rare chance for us to meet.

16
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:07,260
(Eldest Princess, Great-Aunt of Prince Jing)
It is really inconvenient for me to go.

17
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:08,790
Great-Aunt...

18
00:01:12,510 --> 00:01:13,790
Give this string of prayer beads

19
00:01:14,350 --> 00:01:15,590
to her for me

20
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,480
to show my apologies.

21
00:01:24,510 --> 00:01:25,350
Let's leave...

22
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,400
It's already this late.

23
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,360
The Eldest Princess
couldn't possibly be coming.

24
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,120
Let's go.

25
00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:30,510
Here.

26
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:32,680
The palace carriage is here.

27
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:35,510
An imperial edict has arrived.

28
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:39,860
(Eunuch Pang, eunuch)

29
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:42,070
Here's His Majesty's oral decree.

30
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:45,230
The Qis used the Eldest Princess's name

31
00:01:45,230 --> 00:01:46,760
to seek unearned fame,

32
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,950
tarnishing the dignity
of the imperial family.

33
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:53,150
The Qis will be thrown into prison

34
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:54,510
to await trial.

35
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,280
Eunuch Pang,

36
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,760
don't be in a rush.

37
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,280
Listen to me.

38
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,600
This must be a misunderstanding.

39
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,480
A misunderstanding?

40
00:02:02,070 --> 00:02:04,560
It is written right here
in plain black and white

41
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,590
that the Eldest Princess would visit.

42
00:02:06,590 --> 00:02:07,310
Let me ask you,

43
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,710
where is the Eldest Princess?

44
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,590
If you want to blame someone,
go find her.

45
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,990
She was the one who deceived everyone.

46
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,590
It has nothing to do with us.

47
00:02:14,750 --> 00:02:15,190
Yes.

48
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:15,960
It was her.

49
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,190
It's all her.

50
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:18,980
It's all this country girl's doing.

51
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,990
She knows no discretion

52
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,310
and told a monstrous lie.

53
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,700
The welcome ceremony hasn't finished,

54
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:24,400
so she isn't part
of our Qi family at all.

55
00:02:24,410 --> 00:02:25,590
We beg for your mercy, Eunuch,

56
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,120
do not implicate the Qi family.

57
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,120
(Grandfather and Father)

58
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,280
(are silent beneficiaries.)

59
00:02:33,190 --> 00:02:34,150
(Qi Zhao hates me)

60
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,560
(and only wants me dead.)

61
00:02:36,710 --> 00:02:38,560
(Mother is an ignorant accomplice.)

62
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:41,280
Yuan.

63
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,000
(Grandmother's sliver of kindness)

64
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,190
(won't change a thing.)

65
00:02:46,390 --> 00:02:48,150
(I can only gamble
with the account book.)

66
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:51,680
Hold on.

67
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:57,240
If Young Lady Qi leaves now,

68
00:02:57,870 --> 00:03:00,120
wouldn't the Eldest Princess
have come for nothing?

69
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,240
Young Lady Qi specifically instructed me

70
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:15,120
that if you were unable
to come for any reason,

71
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,360
you might want
to take a look at this first

72
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,800
and then make your decision.

73
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:41,580
(and Commandery Princess)

74
00:03:42,590 --> 00:03:44,730
- Greetings, Eldest Princess.
- Greetings, Eldest Princess.

75
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:46,380
- Greetings, Prince Jing.
- Greetings, Prince Jing.

76
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,080
Rise.

77
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,360
Are you Qi Yuan?

78
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,240
Yes.

79
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:07,150
This girl and I
share quite a special bond.

80
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:10,630
I never expected her
to be the daughter of the Qi Residence.

81
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,360
Yes.

82
00:04:12,370 --> 00:04:14,090
I haven't left the mountain
in a long time,

83
00:04:14,290 --> 00:04:16,310
so I did not realize
the atmosphere in the capital

84
00:04:16,310 --> 00:04:17,920
had become so snobbish.

85
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:20,680
I was outside the door just now

86
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,190
and heard every single word

87
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:24,190
of your grand argument.

88
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,800
Looking at it this way,

89
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:29,630
whether she can
acknowledge her ancestors today

90
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:31,480
depends not on her bloodline,

91
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,430
but on whether I came today

92
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,480
or not.

93
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,160
I admit my mistake.

94
00:04:39,330 --> 00:04:40,720
Since you acknowledge your mistake,

95
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:42,160
is this welcome ceremony

96
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,920
still happening or not?

97
00:04:45,630 --> 00:04:46,630
It is.

98
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,150
The auspicious hour has arrived.

99
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,040
Come

100
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:49,870
burn the incense

101
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,830
to pay respects to our ancestors.

102
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:53,950
(Qi Yuan,)

103
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,360
(the good show is about to begin.)

104
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:03,510
Qi Zhen, the seventh-generation
descendant of the Qi family,

105
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,390
hereby strictly abides by protocol

106
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:08,270
to welcome back
our lost flesh and blood.

107
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:17,120
Put out the fire!

108
00:05:20,670 --> 00:05:21,500
Hurry up.

109
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:22,080
Move.

110
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,310
Help.

111
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:25,070
Eldest Princess.

112
00:05:25,510 --> 00:05:26,310
Eldest Princess.

113
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:28,510
- Hurry.
- Eldest Princess.

114
00:05:30,100 --> 00:05:30,850
Hurry, let's go.

115
00:05:32,150 --> 00:05:32,810
Hurry.

116
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:33,680
Fire!

117
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,390
Help.

118
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,070
Lianqiao!

119
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:35,950
Help me.

120
00:05:36,870 --> 00:05:37,510
Lianqiao.

121
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:39,830
Lianqiao.

122
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:41,000
Help!

123
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,950
Put out the fire.

124
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,560
Lianqiao.

125
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:53,480
Watch out!

126
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,240
Young Lady...

127
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:03,240
Are you crazy?

128
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:04,380
You charged into a fire

129
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:05,320
just for a maidservant?

130
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:06,990
She is not a maidservant.

131
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,370
She is the most important person to me.

132
00:06:08,390 --> 00:06:09,040
I saved her

133
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,990
regardless of her status.

134
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:13,040
But you must
ensure your own safety first.

135
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,560
Well...

136
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:16,600
Well, thank you.

137
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:18,830
I...

138
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:23,940
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

139
00:06:23,950 --> 00:06:26,720
This ancestral hall honors
generations of loyal Qi heroes.

140
00:06:27,090 --> 00:06:28,390
Nothing has ever happened here,

141
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,200
yet it caught fire today of all days.

142
00:06:30,430 --> 00:06:31,040
Why?

143
00:06:32,070 --> 00:06:34,270
Because the ancestors of the Qi family

144
00:06:34,830 --> 00:06:36,830
don't recognize you as one of us at all.

145
00:06:37,070 --> 00:06:37,830
That's right.

146
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,310
Before the welcome ceremony
could finish,

147
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,750
the ancestral hall caught fire.

148
00:06:40,750 --> 00:06:41,920
It is indeed bad luck.

149
00:06:42,310 --> 00:06:43,430
Unworthy of the position.

150
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:44,870
Completely unworthy.

151
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,240
You saved me just now.

152
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,070
I know you are a good girl,

153
00:06:52,070 --> 00:06:54,240
and I will remember this kindness.

154
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,560
But now that things have come to this,

155
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,360
aren't you afraid?

156
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,310
In this Qi ancestral hall,

157
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,270
women shed their blood and sweat,

158
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:04,040
yet earn no place of honor.

159
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,830
Men do nothing of note,

160
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:07,390
yet enjoy generations
of incense and worship.

161
00:07:07,630 --> 00:07:09,680
What does it matter
if such an unfair place,

162
00:07:09,690 --> 00:07:10,990
that favors one
over the other, burns down?

163
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:17,190
No wonder Yunting
thinks so highly of you.

164
00:07:20,350 --> 00:07:21,600
What are you standing there for?

165
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,920
Hurry and tie up this jinx.

166
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,630
Insolent!

167
00:07:26,390 --> 00:07:28,270
I have lived in
the mountains for a long time,

168
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:29,560
where mountain fires often occur.

169
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,360
According to you,

170
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,800
am I an omen of bad luck as well?

171
00:07:34,550 --> 00:07:35,990
Please calm your anger, Your Highness.

172
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:38,160
Your Highness is blessed
with good fortune.

173
00:07:38,210 --> 00:07:40,370
The mountain fire was
an auspicious sign from heaven.

174
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,430
Yuan

175
00:07:41,430 --> 00:07:43,360
must have shared
in Your Highness's blessings.

176
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:45,190
I am deeply grateful.

177
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,390
It's just that the ancestral hall
was damaged today

178
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:50,190
and will take months to repair.

179
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:51,680
I ask for Your Highness's permission

180
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:54,270
to hold the welcome ceremony
on another day.

181
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,120
No one was hurt anyway.

182
00:07:56,330 --> 00:07:57,920
I think the moonlight is lovely tonight,

183
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,750
so why not let heaven
and earth be the witness,

184
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,900
and let Young Lady Qi
return to her family roots now?

185
00:08:02,190 --> 00:08:03,000
Great-Aunt,

186
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,720
what do you think?

187
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,800
Good.

188
00:08:05,510 --> 00:08:06,560
Go and prepare now.

189
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,630
Yes.

190
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:02,320
That you return
to your family roots today

191
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,600
is a blessing for the Qi family,

192
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:05,120
and it is also the will of heaven.

193
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,270
This hairpin was prepared by Yunting.

194
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,870
I am merely passing it to you,

195
00:09:12,270 --> 00:09:14,440
wishing only that it will keep you safe.

196
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:19,870
From now on, Qi Yuan is recognized by me

197
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:20,960
as the eldest daughter of the Qi family.

198
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:22,840
If anyone dares to speak out against it,

199
00:09:22,870 --> 00:09:24,550
it will be seen as disrespect toward me.

200
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,030
- Yes, Your Highness.
- Yes, Your Highness.

201
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:30,600
I will do

202
00:09:30,610 --> 00:09:32,030
(I'll avenge Prince Consort and Commandery Princess)
as the letter says.

203
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:32,870
Absurd!

204
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,840
His Majesty couldn't uncover
the truth in over 20 years.

205
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:35,910
How could you,
a mere daughter of a Marquis,

206
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:37,030
ever clear it up?

207
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:50,720
Great-Aunt,

208
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,120
why not hear her out first

209
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:54,750
and see how she explains?

210
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:58,200
Actually,

211
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,200
I am living a second life.

212
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:03,120
Or rather,

213
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:05,270
I had a dream about a past life.

214
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:06,360
Everything in that dream

215
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:08,120
mirrors what is happening now.

216
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:10,030
Perhaps you find all this absurd,

217
00:10:10,390 --> 00:10:10,630
but...

218
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:11,360
It isn't absurd.

219
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:15,120
You were stranded in the wild
yet possessed martial arts,

220
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:18,510
found the Qis' account books
as soon as you returned,

221
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,870
and even knew my father
was secretly poisoned.

222
00:10:22,010 --> 00:10:23,200
All these strange things...

223
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:29,200
According to what you said,

224
00:10:30,210 --> 00:10:31,720
it actually becomes
a logical explanation.

225
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,030
Tell us, then.

226
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,670
What do you know from your past life?

227
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,080
Back then, Consort Great Liu,

228
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,480
who encountered the bandits along
with the Princess and her husband,

229
00:10:42,570 --> 00:10:43,840
was the key witness in this case.

230
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:45,030
She is still alive.

231
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,790
Consort Great Liu
and His Majesty shared deep affection.

232
00:10:50,090 --> 00:10:51,030
After the bandit attack,

233
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:53,240
His Majesty secretly sent the Qi family

234
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,730
to investigate
Consort Great Liu's whereabouts

235
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,670
and uncover the truth.

236
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,750
The Qi Residence was
bent on currying favor with Prince Qi.

237
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,150
Even if they found Consort Great Liu,

238
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,960
they would hand her over to Prince Qi.

239
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:02,030
In my past life,

240
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,200
Prince Qi killed Consort Great Liu,

241
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:06,790
which turned this case
into an unsolved case.

242
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,270
This also proves

243
00:11:08,390 --> 00:11:09,790
that the mastermind behind this case

244
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,080
was him.

245
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:15,550
With Consort Great Liu missing,

246
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,030
Consort Little Liu used

247
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:18,780
His Majesty's longing
for Consort Great Liu

248
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,350
to win absolute favor in the harem

249
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,670
and thus gave birth to Prince Qi.

250
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,320
So the culprit is...

251
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:30,870
- Consort Little Liu.
- Consort Little Liu.

252
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:46,880
♪How I wish to hold
onto this fleeting warmth♪

253
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:51,040
♪How I wish to live
this life only for you♪

254
00:11:51,550 --> 00:11:57,010
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

255
00:11:57,230 --> 00:12:01,390
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

256
00:12:02,180 --> 00:12:06,460
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

257
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:14,160
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
